    {
      "id": "schema-customer",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 360,
      "text": "## Schema: Customer\n- **Contract kind:** database\n- **Version:** 1.0.0\n- **Owner:** Tower\n- **Status:** active\n- **Review status:** approved\n- **Reviewed version:** 1.0.0\n- **Last reviewed:** 2026-10-01\n- **Review interval (days):** 180",
      "app": {
        "entityType": "schema",
        "fields": {
          "name": "Customer",
          "kind": "database",
          "version": "1.0.0",
          "owner": "Tower",
          "status": "active",
          "reviewStatus": "approved",
          "reviewedVersion": "1.0.0",
          "lastReviewed": "2026-10-01",
          "reviewIntervalDays": 180,
          "source": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"$id\": \"https://canvas.local/erd/customer/1.0.0\",\n  \"title\": \"Customer\",\n  \"description\": \"A commerce customer.\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"customer_id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"email\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"format\": \"email\"\n    },\n    \"display_name\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"created_at\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"format\": \"date-time\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"customer_id\",\n    \"email\",\n    \"created_at\"\n  ]\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "schema-order",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 400,
      "text": "## Schema: Order\n- **Contract kind:** database\n- **Version:** 1.0.0\n- **Owner:** Tower\n- **Status:** active\n- **Review status:** approved\n- **Reviewed version:** 1.0.0\n- **Last reviewed:** 2026-10-01\n- **Review interval (days):** 180",
      "app": {
        "entityType": "schema",
        "fields": {
          "name": "Order",
          "kind": "database",
          "version": "1.0.0",
          "owner": "Tower",
          "status": "active",
          "reviewStatus": "approved",
          "reviewedVersion": "1.0.0",
          "lastReviewed": "2026-10-01",
          "reviewIntervalDays": 180,
          "source": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"$id\": \"https://canvas.local/erd/order/1.0.0\",\n  \"title\": \"Order\",\n  \"description\": \"A customer order header.\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"order_id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"customer_id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"status\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"pending\",\n        \"paid\",\n        \"shipped\",\n        \"cancelled\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"total_cents\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\",\n      \"minimum\": 0\n    },\n    \"created_at\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"format\": \"date-time\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"order_id\",\n    \"customer_id\",\n    \"status\",\n    \"total_cents\",\n    \"created_at\"\n  ]\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "schema-order-item",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 880,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 380,
      "text": "## Schema: Order Item\n- **Contract kind:** database\n- **Version:** 1.0.0\n- **Owner:** Tower\n- **Status:** active\n- **Review status:** approved\n- **Reviewed version:** 1.0.0\n- **Last reviewed:** 2026-10-01\n- **Review interval (days):** 180",
      "app": {
        "entityType": "schema",
        "fields": {
          "name": "Order Item",
          "kind": "database",
          "version": "1.0.0",
          "owner": "Tower",
          "status": "active",
          "reviewStatus": "approved",
          "reviewedVersion": "1.0.0",
          "lastReviewed": "2026-10-01",
          "reviewIntervalDays": 180,
          "source": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"$id\": \"https://canvas.local/erd/order-item/1.0.0\",\n  \"title\": \"Order Item\",\n  \"description\": \"A line item on an order.\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"order_item_id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"order_id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"sku\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"quantity\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\",\n      \"minimum\": 1\n    },\n    \"unit_price_cents\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\",\n      \"minimum\": 0\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"order_item_id\",\n    \"order_id\",\n    \"sku\",\n    \"quantity\",\n    \"unit_price_cents\"\n  ]\n}"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
